  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44129820",
      "title": "Practice: Adding More Validation",
      "lectureOrder": 263,
      "videoOrder": 251,
      "sourceHash": "bd32bfbb9e4d725e69d7a4916f4e6375ad0725b882fe78f5ada3800f161a5df5",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.9,
          "end": 2.64,
          "en": "Now with all that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.64,
          "end": 7.29,
          "en": "we're pretty much done with that big signup form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.29,
          "end": 9.75,
          "en": "Of course, you can play around more with that form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.75,
          "end": 12.66,
          "en": "and try to add more features, but here for me,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.66,
          "end": 17.66,
          "en": "I just want to add two last features to that form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.88,
          "end": 22.68,
          "en": "And the first feature is one we already worked with before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.68,
          "end": 25.56,
          "en": "I want to show some error message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.56,
          "end": 28.2,
          "en": "if the user submits an invalid form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.2,
          "end": 31.62,
          "en": "And I wanna make sure that we don't continue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.62,
          "end": 34.5,
          "en": "in our TypeScript code here in onSubmit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.5,
          "end": 36.963,
          "en": "if an invalid form has been submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.28,
          "end": 40.08,
          "en": "And I'll start with that actually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.08,
          "end": 44.4,
          "en": "Here in onSubmit, we can check if this.form.invalid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.4,
          "end": 48.15,
          "en": "which will be true if at least one of all the controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.15,
          "end": 51.06,
          "en": "in the entire form is invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.06,
          "end": 52.41,
          "en": "So if the form is invalid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.41,
          "end": 56.22,
          "en": "then I wanna return so that this code doesn't execute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.22,
          "end": 60.43,
          "en": "And here I'll console.log INVALID FORM",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.29,
          "end": 62.433,
          "en": "that's the first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.63,
          "end": 66.6,
          "en": "With that, if we save that, if I reload, if I try",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.6,
          "end": 69.663,
          "en": "to submit this empty form, I get INVALID FORM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.67,
          "end": 73.86,
          "en": "But I now also wanna show an error message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.86,
          "end": 78.393,
          "en": "let's say here, or below these buttons, wherever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.8,
          "end": 81.93,
          "en": "And for that, I'll now go to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.93,
          "end": 84.543,
          "en": "the signup.component.html file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.77,
          "end": 89.13,
          "en": "And here at the very bottom I'll add a paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.13,
          "end": 94.13,
          "en": "with a class of control-error where I'll say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 94.35,
          "end": 99.35,
          "en": "invalid form data - please check your input data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 100.89,
          "end": 104.163,
          "en": "Or maybe just invalid form - please check your input data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 105.66,
          "end": 108.03,
          "en": "And I want to output this conditionally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 108.03,
          "end": 113.03,
          "en": "if my form is invalid, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 113.55,
          "end": 116.78999999999999,
          "en": "Of course, we could be much more granular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 116.78999999999999,
          "end": 119.64,
          "en": "and output different error messages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 119.64,
          "end": 121.14,
          "en": "also in different places,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 121.14,
          "end": 124.29,
          "en": "maybe right below the input to which they belong,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 124.29,
          "end": 125.973,
          "en": "for individual inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 126.84,
          "end": 129.69,
          "en": "so that we give the user a more granular feedback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 129.69,
          "end": 130.98,
          "en": "regarding what's wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 130.98,
          "end": 133.59,
          "en": "Because this of course is a pretty generic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.59,
          "end": 135.393,
          "en": "and general message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.23,
          "end": 138.9,
          "en": "Nonetheless here, you'll see if I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 138.9,
          "end": 140.403,
          "en": "this message shows up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.63,
          "end": 144,
          "en": "Actually right from the start, which is, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 144,
          "end": 145.47,
          "en": "not what I want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.47,
          "end": 150.47,
          "en": "Therefore, I'll enhance this and check if form is dirty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 150.72,
          "end": 155.72,
          "en": "and form was touched, so the user did interact with it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 158.64,
          "end": 161.88,
          "en": "Now, if I say this, initially, I don't see the message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 161.88,
          "end": 164.31,
          "en": "but if I then tap into an input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 164.31,
          "end": 167.73,
          "en": "enter something and then remove that so that it's invalid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 167.73,
          "end": 169.083,
          "en": "I see that message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 170.1,
          "end": 173.19,
          "en": "And actually I'll get rid of that dirty check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 173.19,
          "end": 176.94,
          "en": "and just show that error as soon as the form was touched",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 176.94,
          "end": 178.71,
          "en": "and is invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 178.71,
          "end": 181.2,
          "en": "With that, it's enough to tap in there and out of there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.2,
          "end": 182.643,
          "en": "to see that error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 183.6,
          "end": 185.37,
          "en": "So that's what I'll do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 185.37,
          "end": 187.95,
          "en": "But as mentioned, you could definitely also output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 187.95,
          "end": 191.313,
          "en": "more granular control specific error messages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 192.69,
          "end": 195.54,
          "en": "I'll not do that here though to save some time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 195.54,
          "end": 199.02,
          "en": "because I instead now wanna finally show you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 199.02,
          "end": 200.88,
          "en": "how you can create a validator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 200.88,
          "end": 204.24,
          "en": "that actually checks two controls at the same time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 204.24,
          "end": 208.56,
          "en": "And in this case, make sure that we have the same value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 208.56,
          "end": 209.793,
          "en": "in both controls.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
